  "schematicNotes": [
    {
      "id": "n_cavity_notes",
      "text": "CAVITY NOTES - full text of the signals marked * on this drawing\nCondenser Fan Relay (on/off, diode) 85: ACTIVE-LOW Coil - -> Ign 5 / B13 - low-side, no external flywheel diode or suppression (on/off relay; INFERENCE from the G4X help Auxiliary Output Wiring PWM-only diode advice, not a Link statement) - fitted TE 7-1904094-9 has its own coil diode, keep 86 = coil +\nCondenser Fan Relay (on/off, diode) 86: Coil + - ignition-switched 12V (EFI main relay 87)\nMR-S EHPS pump relay (HCR150,  85: ACTIVE-LOW Coil - <- ECU-B B12 (Ign 6) - EPS relay trigger; moved into the cabin 2026-09-28 (Daniel: every relay in the cabin)\nMR-S EHPS pump relay (HCR150,  30: HCFB H4 - Bussmann AMI-60 (60 A, sized 2026-09-28 - sot/channels.csv k_eps c1)\nHigh-current fuse block HCFB h4: Bussmann AMI-60 (60 A, sized 2026-09-28 - sot/channels.csv k_eps c1)\nECU-B b27: DI 10 anti-theft input - the wire is drawn on ST185-AntiTheft (broken off)",
      "schematicPosition": {
        "x": 4200,
        "y": 0
      }
    }
  ],
